s, Gories, Original Sins, God Bullies, Pandoras. La psicodelia libre de jams: Crystallized Movements, Magic Hour, Vocokesh, Sun City Girls, Black Sun Ensemble, Helios Creed. En Australia, Celibate Rifles, Died Pretty, Hoodoo Gurus, Beasts Of Bourbon, Scientists, Feedtime, Crime And The City Solution; en Europa, Hanoi Rocks, Echo & The Bunnymen, Teardrop Explodes, Bevis Frond, Legendary Pink Dots, The The y Love And Rockets.","color":"#c084fc","family":"Psicodelia, garage y shoegaze","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#psych-revival"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":276958960811877,"artist":"Feedtime","artist_id":6879158909629,"title":"Feedtime","year":1986,"ess":1,"yt":"6c-TfR8KKik","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Revival psicodélico y garage de los ochenta","scene_id":246547991277401,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#psych-revival","chapters":["Sección 5.14"],"pages":[[1,173,null]]},{"id":281357772634024,"artist":"Feedtime","artist_id":6879158909629,"title":"Shovel","year":1986,"ess":0,"yt":"riIOsYg5yyc","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Revival psicodélico y garage de los ochenta","scene_id":246547991277401,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#psych-revival","chapters":["Sección 5.14"],"pages":[[1,173,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":173,"text":"…Run On Blood (1984), Atom Bomb Baby (1985) and Demolition Derby (1985). The most ferocious and uplifting gang of Australian garage-rock was probably Feedtime (11). They delivered the demonic bacchanals of Feedtime (1986) with the production quality of a nuclear radiation and the aplomb of rampaging Hun warriors. The anthemic, epileptic and spastic rock'n'roll…"},{"book":"A History of Rock Mus